        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulse Grid is a rhythm-puzzle game where colored blocks slide across the grid to the beat. Change arrow directions in your central 2x2 zone to redirect them, match colors, and build combos before you run out of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 37 beatmaps with over 90 minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks appear at the edges and move at different intervals (1/4, 1/2, 1, 2, or 4 beats). You control a fixed 2x2 arrow zone in the center—change the arrow directions to redirect any blocks that pass through. When blocks can't move forward, they stop. Match same-colored blocks together to clear them and score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Game Modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Match Mode: Match 3+ blocks of the same color. Combos multiply your score exponentially (up to x8192 maximum)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Edge Mode: Each edge has a target color. Blocks that hit their matching edge award points with the same combo system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each song has its own patterns and difficulty. Learn the rhythm, find your flow, and watch your scores climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pure rhythm gameplay - Everything happens on the beat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic arrow control - Change directions in the center zone to manage the grid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Global leaderboards - Compete on every song and watch replays of top runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like puzzle games with rhythm, you'll feel right at home here</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulse Grid is a rhythm-puzzle game where colored blocks slide across the grid to the beat. Change arrow directions in your central 2x2 zone to redirect them, match colors, and build combos before you run out of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 37 beatmaps with over 90 minutes of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks appear at the edges and move at different intervals (1/4, 1/2, 1, 2, or 4 beats). You control a fixed 2x2 arrow zone in the center—change the arrow directions to redirect any blocks that pass through. When blocks can't move forward, they stop. Match same-colored blocks together to clear them and score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Game Modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Match Mode: Match 3+ blocks of the same color. Combos multiply your score exponentially (up to x8192 maximum)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Edge Mode: Each edge has a target color. Blocks that hit their matching edge award points with the same combo system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each song has its own patterns and difficulty. Learn the rhythm, find your flow, and watch your scores climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pure rhythm gameplay - Everything happens on the beat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic arrow control - Change directions in the center zone to manage the grid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Global leaderboards - Compete on every song and watch replays of top runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like puzzle games with rhythm, you'll feel right at home here</p>",
        "short_description": "Pulse Grid is a rhythm-based puzzle game where colored arrows move to the beat. Redirect them by moving and rotating your 2x2 control zone, match colors, and build combos. Master the rhythm to dominate global leaderboards.",
